  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>  (Mohr's salt)  <math><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>Equivalent of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo></math>  moles of Mohr's salt<br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo></math>  equivalent of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/>Hence mole percent of Mohr's salt<br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></math>"
